reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "0eee12505e83e615c4929690ea88fa8d", "ts": "1756237277.915139", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "text": "we need to figure out how to bring in zombies under 5mb :slightly_smiling_face:", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "7bf9e2c6704d970a2d02398a794d14f9", "ts": "1756313677.542959", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "text": "testflight build is approved", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "98565d4b5b46d2e2e7c852ebdb3b2733", "ts": "1756313684.652249", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "text": "let me know if you can download it now", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "ea8bec482aad0ddcef8a7e246e6a817f", "ts": "1756321837.876699", "type": "message", "user": "PERSON_3937_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hey! We were able to download the game via festflight, thank you so much Leonard for the quick action. Everything looks good. Once we\u2019ve compiled our notes, <@PERSON_6078_SLACK_ID> our product manager will be leading the process. After that, we\u2019ll get back in touch to schedule the kick-off", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 1, "name": "raised_hands", "users": ["PERSON_6078_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "6e32703b50f074e78434ce7351c58c69", "ts": "1756373440.934409", "type": "message", "user": "PERSON_6078_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hi <@EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID>,\nI'll analyze the game and write up the scenarios, which I'll send to you later today. Before that, I had a chance to play the game, and I found it really enjoyable\u2014great work!\nI also wanted to share a bug I encountered while playing. I couldn't figure out the exact cause, so I've attached a video. In the second level, when I first played it, the *zombie was still alive even though There were no more items left on the board to throw*.\nWhen I exited the level and played it again, the same thing happened, but this time the zombie's health somehow reset, and I was able to continue the level.", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [{"created": 1756372677, "display_as_bot": false, "duration_ms": 70070, "editable": false, "external_type": "", "file_access": "visible", "filetype": "mp4", "has_rich_preview": false, "hls": "https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T07J19BNDBL-F09CUQERF7T-ddeb80d13b/file.m3u8?_xcb=8911a&t=xoxb-REDACTED", "hls_embed": "data:application/vnd.apple.mpegurl;base64,", "id": "F09CUQERF7T", "is_external": false, "is_public": false, "is_starred": false, "is_transcription_region_supported": true, "media_display_type": "video", "mimetype": "video/mp4", "mode": "hosted", "mp4_low": "https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T07J19BNDBL-F09CUQERF7T-ddeb80d13b/file_trans.mp4?t=xoxb-REDACTED", "name": "bug.mp4", "permalink": "https://playablex.slack.com/files/EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID/F09CUQERF7T/bug.mp4", "permalink_public": "https://slack-files.com/T07J19BNDBL-F09CUQERF7T-6370eb6bfb", "pretty_type": "MPEG 4 Video", "public_url_shared": false, "size": 127505830, "skipped_shares": true, "source_team": "T07J19BNDBL", "thumb_video": "https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T07J19BNDBL-F09CUQERF7T-ddeb80d13b/bug_thumb_video.jpeg?t=xoxb-REDACTED", "thumb_video_h": 1920, "thumb_video_w": 886, "timestamp": 1756372677, "title": "bug.mp4", "transcription": {"status": "none"}, "url_private": "https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T07J19BNDBL-F09CUQERF7T/bug.mp4?token=xoxb-REDACTED", "url_private_download": "https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T07J19BNDBL-F09CUQERF7T/download/bug.mp4?token=xoxb-REDACTED", "user": "PERSON_6078_SLACK_ID", "user_team": "T07J19BNDBL", "username": ""}], "attachments": []}, {"id": "2c32f1341cdac095c2fc1a3978201407", "ts": "1756373673.416449", "type": "message", "user": "PERSON_6078_SLACK_ID", "text": "I also have another note: My device is an *iPhone 16*. I was playing the game when my battery was around 20-15%, and as I progressed through the levels, the game started to *lag*. I can say that playing the *endless level* feature was particularly difficult.", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "27c0c417a06cb45806315ce88fc8badb", "ts": "1756391616.026279", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "text": "Thank you. We must have intro\u2019ed a bug for level 2 when we were making a custom testflight build for you guys. Probably we merged something that wasn\u2019t properly tested. ", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "53a1eced5fb001a3cdedd24a920f5017", "ts": "1756391634.106759", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "text": "We are aware of the stutters - team is working on a fix ", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "76f2db2d2625edb21801359475ade999", "ts": "1756391647.155359", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "text": "Thank you for the notes!!! :[USERNAME_46456]: ", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "kirby_dance", "users": ["PERSON_6078_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "42d0c0df103f9f29f6df8a1bf1a0ee7b", "ts": "1756391684.632219", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "text": "Fwiw the game economy is also super off. Hopefully you will see how item progression is gonna work by the next release  ", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "08e8332581dc45cce25594211e6bd34a", "ts": "1756391911.500069", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "text": "It\u2019s fair to say that we are a month away from beta. Still lacking tons of polish vfx etc too ", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "3e1cc63cca040278749d647cf06ecc5d", "ts": "1756393065.804409", "type": "message", "user": "PERSON_6078_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hello <@EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID>,\nYou can find the ideas we've been working on for this playable at the <https://docs.google.com/document/d/179Od87P5qUTLYyrJylt5Jo7E-i15V8WuoWwCnuvIRv0/edit?tab=t.0|link> below.\n\u2022 *Scenario 1:* This is based on the core game mechanics.\n\u2022 *Scenario 2:* This is built around the bomb mechanic on the in-game board.\n\u2022 *Scenario 3:* This was inspired by high-interaction playables from games like <https://x-ad-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/media_asset/80eaaee61e35a8b9/media|Royal Match> and <https://x-ad-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/media_asset/d021f374efd00f69/index.html|Ma[USERNAME_30464]>.\n\u2022 *Scenario 4:* This is a new scenario created as a combination of the previous ones.\nWe can start discussing and planning the project based on the scenario you choose.", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": "1756393065.804409", "reply_count": 1, "reply_users_count": 1, "latest_reply": "1756399743.414909", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "3e1ebcbe0d79b992042770ca6591191f", "ts": "1756399743.414909", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "text": "Thank you will review and circle back with you", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": "1756393065.804409", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "ee132c8e05527f60f3075df831786787", "ts": "1756399976.644599", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID> <@EMPLOYEE_0008_SLACK_ID> <@EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID> <@EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID> ^ let\u2019s review the scenarios together", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "1276016c987c903532793df535f6801e", "ts": "1756399980.320439", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID> has joined the channel", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": "channel_join", "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "ed2901d39d1565ff82fcfd1bb476d430", "ts": "1756402043.104259", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I like the Match Factory one", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "4c185ddc0db4e486fbebeaf3e2f47e7a", "ts": "1756404056.404979", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID", "text": "I also liked the third option, but my only concern is that it might not be as exciting as the other two since we don't have an avatar to associate with.", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "de6fe2755890e40b52a36659851ce9b8", "ts": "1756452358.461719", "type": "message", "user": "PERSON_6078_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hello <!here>, thank you for your valuable feedback! As <@EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID> mentioned, if we use a character it will strengthen all scenarios and help players build an emotional connection. If you already have a character, we can integrate it into all scenarios.\n\nIf you have a preferred scenario in mind, we\u2019re happy to consider that as well. Our suggestion, however, is to move forward with *Scenario 1 and highlight the basic gameplay*. Presenting the game in its simplest and most authentic form allows players to clearly understand the core mechanic. This way, they can evaluate the game more accurately, and your first tests will deliver much cleaner results.\n\nIn short, *a simple playable = strong first impression + clear mechanic focus + lower drop-off*, which ultimately means more reliable test outcomes.", "channel": "C08H78VJG80", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}]